<Sequence DisplayName="DHL Incident RPA - Scenario 2 (OpenAI)" sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="DHL Incident RPA - Scenario 2 (Incident Reporting System)&#xA;Single inbox folder: &lt;InboxRoot&gt;\Incoming (Gmail + Drive fetches land here; you can also drop files in manually).&#xA;Files sharing a prefix before '__' are one case (e.g. MY987623400__email.txt + MY987623400__photo.jpg).&#xA;Per case: read -&gt; dedup -&gt; OpenAI extraction (text, images, PDFs) -&gt; POST import-bundle -&gt; PATCH status -&gt; report.&#xA;Set OPENAI_API_KEY as a Windows user environment variable (setx OPENAI_API_KEY &quot;sk-...&quot;) or fill the OpenAIApiKey variable." sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_43">
